  "Domains or LinkedIn company URLs to match exactly, e.g. \"stripe.com\".": "要精確比對的網域或 LinkedIn 公司 URL，例如 \"stripe.com\"。",
  "Only match the office marked as the company headquarters, not any office.": "只比對標示為公司總部的辦公室，不要比對任何辦公室。",
  "Matches companies whose description contains this word or phrase.": "比對描述中包含此字詞或片語的公司。",
  "Optional raw filter, ANDed onto the filters above. See Clay's advanced search query syntax: https://developers.clay.com/searches/advanced": "可選的原始篩選條件，會以 AND 與上方篩選條件結合。請參閱 Clay 的進階搜尋查詢語法：https://developers.clay.com/searches/advanced",
  "Matches similar titles too (e.g. \"VP of Sales\" also matches \"Head of Sales\").": "也會比對相似的職稱（例如 \"VP of Sales\" 也會比對 \"Head of Sales\"）。",
  "Matches people at these exact companies. Scoped by Employment Tenure above.": "比對這些精確公司中的人員。以上方的任職年資為範圍。",
  "Fuzzy employer name match, use when you don't have a domain. Scoped by Employment Tenure above.": "模糊比對雇主名稱；當你沒有網域時使用。以上方的任職年資為範圍。",
  "From the table's webhook source in Clay, the value in its Webhook URL panel. Only https addresses on clay.com are accepted.": "來自 Clay 中該資料表的 webhook 來源，其 Webhook URL 面板中的值。只接受 clay.com 上的 https 位址。",
  "The token Clay showed when the source was created. Leave empty only if the source has none. Clay shows it once, so use Refresh auth token on the source if it was not saved.": "Clay 在建立來源時顯示的權杖。只有在來源沒有時才留空。Clay 只會顯示一次，因此如果尚未儲存，請在來源上使用重新整理驗證權杖。",
  "The fields to send, as key-value pairs. Keys should match the source's Setup mapping panel.": "要傳送的欄位，採鍵值對形式。鍵應與來源的設定對應面板相符。",
  "Authorization headers are injected automatically from your connection.": "授权头自动从您的连接中注入。",
  "Appended to the URL as ?key=value.": "以 ?key=value 形式附加到 URL。",
  "Enable for files like PDFs, images, etc.": "Enable for files like PDFs, images, etc.",
