  "Seconds to wait for a response. Empty: up to the flow limit (10 min).": "等待响应的秒数。留空：最长为流程上限（10 分钟）。",
  "Follow 3xx redirects instead of returning them as the response.": "跟随 3xx 重定向，而不是将其作为响应返回。",
